title: my territory, and where to start reading
pid: f22b55f0-898d-4838-83e3-e4301342f2a5
body: |2-
  True as of commit 4c475f48 of the code repo, '/home/ubuntu/host'. 'git log 4c475f48..HEAD -- PATH' shows what may have changed since.
  With Jeff I keep the documentation a user reads. I write from what a user sees
  and does, and I do not read the code to learn it: other specialists own the code,
  and a fact I need from it is a question for them. The entry page is
  'docs/README.org'; the project has no README at its root.
